WEBVTT

00:02:59.091 --> 00:03:01.719
And from that moment on,
I stayed in that basement

00:03:01.761 --> 00:03:05.389
in the dead of the Afghan
winter, for 105 days.

00:03:06.724 --> 00:03:10.394
The entire time, I feared that I might be
taken in front of a firing squad,

00:03:10.436 --> 00:03:11.562
at any minute.

00:03:12.730 --> 00:03:14.857
And on the 45th day,

00:03:14.899 --> 00:03:17.944
I was beaten and tortured
by 11 men wielding pipes,

00:03:17.985 --> 00:03:20.363
after eight days on a hunger strike.

00:03:21.906 --> 00:03:23.574
I had done nothing wrong.

00:03:25.576 --> 00:03:26.994
But again, I was lucky.

00:03:26.994 --> 00:03:29.497
I not only had several
exceptional advocates,

00:03:29.538 --> 00:03:30.873
but I had a state.